      en: ["Part of the Mamula-Arza-Prevlaka defense triangle", "Built around 1850", "Massive walls made of local limestone", "Controlled access to the Boka Kotorska Bay", "Contains underground ammunition magazines", "A popular destination for ruins photography"],
