      en: ["The monastery was established in the 10th or 11th century.", "It was the original burial site of Prince Jovan Vladimir.", "Ostros served as the seat of the medieval Zeta Bishopric.", "The site is located amidst famous ancient chestnut forests.", "The monastery was destroyed during the Ottoman invasions.", "The relics of Jovan Vladimir were later transferred to Elbasan."],
      es: ["Año de construcción: 1450", "Altitud sobre el mar: 300 m", "Distancia al lago Skadar: 5 km", "Número de frescos: 8", "Superficie del complejo: 0,2 hectáreas", "Vides en el monasterio: 200"],
